<P STYLE="text-align: center; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 1px; color: White">9 BEAMR BEAMR SUPERCHARGES NVIDIA NVENC TO ACCELERATE CONTENT - ADAPTIVE VIDEO ENCODING BY UP TO  10 X  NVIDIA, a multinational technology company and a leading developer of GPUs,  with an annual revenue of $ 26.9  billion for the fiscal year  2022 . NVIDIA COLLABORATION &#8220; By collaborating with BEAMR, we made the NVENC API much more flexible, enabling it to run  multiple passes and achieve unbounded quality for BEAMR's CABR. &#8221;   said Andrew Page, director of  advanced technologies in the professional visualization group at NVIDIA. NVIDIA GPUs with NVENC are available on all major cloud platforms, including Amazon AWS,  Microsoft Azure, Google Cloud, IBM Cloud, Oracle Cloud, Alibaba Cloud, Baidu Cloud and Tencent  Cloud. 1 1  &#8211; Beamr PR  - FEBRUARY  14 ,  2022  - https:// www.prweb.com /releases/ 2022 / 2 /prweb 18495856 .htm</P>

