<P STYLE="text-align: center; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 1px; color: White"> 14 BEAMR Setup One - click setup using cloud  formation templates: create  buckets, provide Beamr access,  and create events that trigger  Beamr &#8217; s optimization when a  new bucket object is added. Go Beamr reads source files from  input bucket, optimizes them,  and places the optimized files in  the output bucket. Monitor Service dashboard shows file  size reduction and estimated cost savings. 5 % BEAMR Cloud Video Optimization Service</P>

