<P STYLE="text-align: center; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 1px; color: White">17 BEAMR Integration with Nvidia  Phase  1  &#9642; Integrate with Nvidia  video engine. &#9642; v. 1.0  of the Integrated  video optimization  engine. Test service  with prospective  customers &#9642; Allow beta customers  to use the Beamr cloud  service on a public  cloud platform.  Launch  The BEAMR  SaaS  &#9642; Launch the Beamr  public cloud video  optimization service  v. 1.0 . Q 1 2023 Q 3 2023 Q 1 2024 Expected Timeline &amp; Go To Market </P>

